OL,3,GNEWSAPolice funding used for extra     
OL,4,Apatrols at asylum camp                 
OL,6,FGovernment money to support extra      
OL,7,Fpolicing in Crowborough has gone       
OL,8,Ftowards more patrols, community        
OL,9,Frelations work and managing protests at
OL,10,Fthe former army training camp that now 
OL,11,Fhouses asylum seekers, according to the
OL,12,FChief Constable of Sussex Police Jo    
OL,13,FShiner.                                
OL,15,FShe said that relevant costs were      
OL,16,Fclaimed back from the government only  
OL,17,Fonce the allocated funding had been    
OL,18,Fspent.                                 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
