OL,3,GNEWSAPolice funding used for extra     
OL,4,Apatrols at asylum camp                 
OL,6,FThe chief constable was answering      
OL,7,Fquestions from Sussex police and crime 
OL,8,Fcommissioner Katy Bourne regarding     
OL,9,F#780,000 extra funding from the Home   
OL,10,FOffice.                                
OL,12,FThe money can also be used to pay for  
OL,13,Fofficers to investigate any matters    
OL,14,Farising from the camp, which has housed
OL,15,Fadult single men since January.        
